% demo.elpi: the program the page compiles once, at load: elpiDiff's Julia
% front end (jlfront.elpi, which accumulates ast.elpi) and its tool with the
% browser driver (jsdrive.elpi accumulates adjudge.elpi). The jl-function
% facts of the editor, and then the L0 that jlfront prints, are added to it
% for each click, as new compilation units.
accumulate jlfront.
accumulate jsdrive.
